      "html": "<p>\n<math display=\"block\">\\frac{\\sigma^2(\\sigma+r+c+r_s)(\\sqrt{\\sigma+r} + \\sqrt{r+c} + \\sqrt{c+r})}{\\left\\{ \\sigma + \\sqrt{(r+c)(c+\\sigma)} \\right\\} \\left\\{ \\sigma + \\sqrt{(c+\\sigma)(\\sigma+r)} \\right\\} \\left\\{ -r + \\sqrt{(c+r)(r+c)} \\right\\}}</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">\\frac{\\sigma+r - \\sqrt{\\sigma+r+c+r_s}}{(\\sqrt{\\sigma+r+c+r_s} - \\sigma)(\\sigma+r+c+r_s - r)} = \\sigma+r</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">\\left\\{ \\frac{\\sqrt{(c+r)(r+c+r_s)} - \\sigma}{\\sqrt{(c+r)(c+r_s)} - r} \\right\\} \\left\\{ \\frac{\\sqrt{(r+c)(c+r_s)} - r}{\\sqrt{(r+c)(c+r_s)} - r} \\right\\} = \\frac{\\sqrt{(c+r)(r+c+r_s)} + \\sqrt{(c+r)(c+r_s)}}{\\sqrt{(c+r)(r+c+r_s)} - \\sqrt{(c+r)(c+r_s)}} (\\sigma+r+c+r_s)</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{1} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{3-3^2}{3^2-1}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{3^2-1}{3+3^2}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{3-3^2}{3\\sqrt{3}+3^2}} \\dots</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_1 = s \\quad \\sqrt{1+s_2} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{1+s_1}} \\quad s_1 + 2s_2 + 2s_3 + s = 0</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_2 = s \\quad \\sqrt{s-s_3} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{1+s-s_3} \\quad s = 3</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_1 = s \\quad \\sqrt{s-3} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{s_1+s_2+s_3-1} \\quad +</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_1 = s \\quad \\sqrt{1+s_3} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{s_1+s_2+s_3-1} \\quad +</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_2 = s \\quad \\frac{\\sqrt{s_3+1} - \\sqrt{2s-2}}{\\sqrt{s_3+1} + \\sqrt{2s-2}} = \\frac{s}{1} + s + s_2 + s_3</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_2 = s \\quad \\frac{\\sqrt{s_3+1} - \\sqrt{s-3}}{\\sqrt{s_3+1} + \\sqrt{s-3}} = \\frac{2}{1} (1 + s_2 + s_3 + s_1) \\quad s</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_2 = s \\quad \\frac{\\sqrt{s+3} - \\sqrt{2s-2}}{\\sqrt{s+3} + \\sqrt{2s-2}} = s + s_3</math>\n</p><p>\n<math display=\"block\">s_1 = s \\quad \\frac{\\sqrt{3+s_3} + \\sqrt{r-r_3}}{\\sqrt{3+s_